@startuml
title Vision Data Flow Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Agent / UI" as Agent
actor "Camera / Webcam" as Camera
cloud "Google Gemini API" as GeminiAPI

rectangle "Process 1\nCapture Frame" as P1
rectangle "Process 2\nPreprocess Image" as P2
rectangle "Process 3\nSemantic Detection" as P3
rectangle "Process 4\nValidation + Overlay" as P4
rectangle "Process 5\nPersist Results" as P5

database "D1 Raw Frames" as D1
database "D2 Preprocessed Frames" as D2
database "D3 Final JSON" as D3
database "D4 Debug Overlay" as D4
database "D5 Session Metadata" as D5

Camera --> P1 : image frame
Agent --> P1 : /vision/start, /vision/capture, /vision/stop
P1 --> D1 : raw_frame.jpg
P1 --> P2 : raw image path

P2 --> D2 : preprocessed_frame.jpg
P2 --> P3 : cleaned image

P3 --> GeminiAPI : image + prompt
GeminiAPI --> P3 : structured UI JSON
P3 --> P4 : candidate elements

P4 --> P5 : validated elements
P4 --> D4 : debug_detected.png
P5 --> D3 : final_elements.json
P5 --> D5 : session / processing metadata

note bottom of P3
Optional OCR and YOLO modules exist in the repo,
but the active API path is Gemini-centered.
end note

@enduml
